					]
				},
				{
					"id": 111011402,
					"content": "Yup, Paimon thinks we've already summed up all the key points.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111011403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 111011403,
					"content": "So, back to the matter at hand. The things we need answers on are one, where did those super evil-looking hilichurls come from, and two, what does Starsnatcher have to do with the yakshas. Right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111011404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 111011404,
					"content": "Now to head back to where this all started and commence our investigation! Let's part the fog of mystery that hangs over Jueyun Karst, and let the truth shine through in its full glory!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111011405,
						111011406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 111011405,
					"content": "So we're playing detective now, are we?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111011407
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 111011407,
					"content": "Ehehe! To be honest, Paimon actually hopes he is a real adeptus. Ah... His exorcism techniques seemed real enough, at least...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111011408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 111011408,
					"content": "Hmm, but if we get our hopes up, there's further for them to come down. So it makes sense to investigate thoroughly first, just to be sure!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						111011409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 111011409,
					"content": "Alright, let's head back to Wangshu Inn!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
